hadiths[153]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3205","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo banda naakaam aur khasaare mein raha jis ke dil mein Allah taala ne insaanon ke liye rehem nahi rakha."
"3206","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khalid bin Waleed Allah ki talwaron mein se aik talwar hain."
"3207","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khalid bin Waleed Allah ki talwaron mein se aik talwar hain jise Allah ne mushrikon par khaincha hai."
"3208","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khalid Allah ki talwaron mein se aik talwar hain aur qabile ke kitne achche naujawan hain."
"3209","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushrikon ki mukhalifat karo: moonchhein kaato aur daarhiyan poori rakho."
"3210","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahudiyon ki mukhalifat karo; kyunke wo apne jooton aur mozon mein namaz nahi parhte."
"3211","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere Rab ne mujhe khabar di ke main apni ummat mein aik alamat dekhunga; pas jab use dekhun to kasrat se kahun: Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi, astaghfirullaha wa atoobu ilaih; pas maine use dekh liya hai: Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaye, Makka ki fatah, aur tum logon ko Allah ke deen mein giroh dar giroh dakhil hote dekho to apne Rab ki hamd ke saath tasbeeh karo aur us se maghfirat mango; beshak wo bahut tauba qubool karne wala hai."
"3212","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna kapra apne upar lo aur nange na chalo."
"3213","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Quran chaar se lo: Ibn Masood, Ubay bin Kaab, Muaz bin Jabal aur Saalim Maula Abi Huzaifa se."
"3214","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag se apni dhaal lo: kaho Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar; kyunke ye qayamat ke din aage chalne waliyan, peeche hifazat karne waliyan, pehlu se bachane waliyan bankar aayengi; aur yehi baaqi rehne wali nekiyan hain."
"3215","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujh se lo, mujh se lo; Allah ne un ke liye raasta bana diya hai: kunware ka kunwari se: sau kore aur saal bhar ki jilawatni; aur shaadi-shuda ka shaadi-shuda se: sau kore aur sangsaari."
"3216","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni jaghein pakar lo; kyunke log namaz parh chuke aur apne bistaron par ja chuke hain; aur tum us waqt tak namaz mein rahoge jab tak namaz ka intezar karoge; aur agar kamzor ki kamzori, beemar ki beemari aur haajatmandon ki haajat na hoti to main is namaz ko aadhi raat tak mo'akhkhar karta."
"3217","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ibadat mein se utni lo jitni tum taaqat rakhte ho; kyunke Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao."
"3218","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Amal mein se utna lo jitna tum taaqat rakhte ho; kyunke Allah nahi uktata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao."
"3219","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Lo ae Bani Arfida, taake Yahud aur Nasara jaan lein ke hamare deen mein gunjaish hai."
"3220","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mushk laga hua ru'i ka phaha lo aur us se taharat karo."
"3221","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke maal mein se dastoor ke mutabiq utna lo jo tumhein aur tumhare beton ko kaafi ho."
"3222","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum se pehle walon mein se aik aadmi apne jore mein itraata hua nikla to Allah ne zameen ko hukm diya aur us ne use pakar liya; pas wo qayamat ke din tak us mein dhans-ta chala jayega."
"3223","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Adam se nikah se aaya, zina se nahi."
"3224","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nikah se aaya, zina se nahi."
"3225","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nikah se aaya aur zina se nahi aaya, Adam se lekar mere walid aur walida ne mujhe jana, mujhe jahiliyyat ke zina mein se kuch nahi laga."
"3226","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main nikla tha ke tumhein Shab-e-Qadr batana chahta tha ke do aadmi jhagarne lage to wo mujh se utha li gayi; pas use aakhri ashray mein talash karo: saatwein baqi raat mein, nawein baqi mein ya paanchwein baqi mein."
"3227","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nishaniyon ka nikalna aik doosre ke peeche hai, lagataar aayengi jaise dhaage mein moti lagataar aate hain."
"3228","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka khassi karna roza aur qayam hai."
"3229","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do khaslatein munafiq mein jama nahi hotin: achchi waza'-qata' aur deen ki samajh."
"3230","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do khaslatein hain jin ki musalman banda hifazat kare to jannat mein dakhil ho; khabardar, wo aasaan hain aur un par amal karne wale thore hain: har namaz ke peeche das baar Subhanallah kahe, das baar Alhamdulillah kahe aur das baar Allahu Akbar kahe; pas ye zaban par daidh sau aur meezaan mein daidh hazaar hain; aur jab apna bistar pakre to chauttees baar Allahu Akbar kahe, taintees baar Alhamdulillah kahe aur taintees baar Subhanallah kahe; pas ye zaban par sau aur meezaan mein hazaar hain; pas tum mein se kaun din-raat mein dhai hazaar gunah karta hai?"
"3231","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dawood par Quran halka kar diya gaya tha; wo apne janwaron ko hukm dete to unhein zeen pehnayi jati aur wo apne janwaron ke zeen pehne jane se pehle Quran parh lete; aur apne haath ki kamayi ke siwa nahi khate the."
"3232","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine tumhare darmiyan do cheezein chhori hain, un ke baad tum kabhi gumrah nahi hoge: Allah ki kitaab aur meri sunnat; aur ye donon juda nahi honge yahan tak ke mere paas hauz par aayenge."
"3233","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ko apni soorat par paida kiya aur un ki lambayi saath haath thi; phir farmaya: Jao aur un jamaa't ko salam karo, aur wo farishton ki aik jamaa't baithe the; aur suno wo tumhein kiya jawab dete hain, kyunke yehi tumhara aur tumhari aulaad ka salam hai; to wo gaye aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum; unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika wa rahmatullah; pas unhon ne wa rahmatullah ka izafa kiya; pas jo jannat mein dakhil hoga Adam ki soorat par dakhil hoga, un ki lambayi mein saath haath; phir makhlooq un ke baad ghatti rahi yahan tak ke ab tak."
"3234","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam ko paida kiya aur un ke dayen kandhe ko thapka to safaid aulaad nikli goya doodh hai; phir un ke bayen kandhe ko thapka to kaali aulaad nikli goya koyele hain; farmaya: Ye jannat mein hain aur mujhe parwah nahi; aur ye aag mein hain aur mujhe parwah nahi."
"3235","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne mitti ko Hafta ke din paida kiya, us mein pahar Itwaar ke din paida kiye, darakht Peer ke din paida kiye, napasand cheez Mangal ke din paida ki, noor Budh ke din paida kiya, us mein janwar Jumeraat ke din phailaye, aur Adam ko Juma ke din Asr ke baad paida kiya, makhlooq mein sab se aakhir mein, Juma ki ghariyon mein se aakhri ghari mein, Asr se raat ke darmiyan."
"3236","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne sau rehematein paida kein; aik rehmat apni makhlooq ke darmiyan rakh di jis se wo aik doosre par rehem karte hain; aur apne paas ninyanwe chhupa lein."
"3237","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ne Yahya bin Zakariya ko un ki maa ke pet mein momin paida kiya aur Firaun ko us ki maa ke pet mein kafir paida kiya."
"3238","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Farishte noor se paida kiye gaye, jinn aag ke shole se paida kiye gaye, aur Adam us se paida kiye gaye jo tumhein bataya gaya."
"3239","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne haathon aur pairon ki ungliyon mein khilaal karo."
"3240","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch paanch ke badle mein hain: jo qaum ehad todti hai us par un ka dushman musallat kar diya jata hai; aur jo us ke siwa faisla karte hain jo Allah ne utara to un mein faqr phail jata hai; aur un mein behayai zahir nahi hoti magar un mein maut phail jati hai; aur jo naap-tol mein kami karte hain to un se paidawar rok li jati hai aur qeht mein pakre jate hain; aur jo zakat rokte hain to un se baarish rok li jati hai."
"3241","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch cheezein musalman ke liye us ke bhai par wajib hain: salam ka jawab, chheenkne wale ko yarhamukallah kehna, dawat qubool karna, mareez ki iyadat aur janaze ke saath jana."
"3242","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazein hain jinhein Allah azzawajal ne farz kiya; jo un ka wuzu achchi tarah kare, unhein un ke waqt par parhe, un ke rukoo aur khushoo ko poora kare to Allah par us ka ehad hai ke use bakhsh de; aur jo aisa na kare to Allah par us ka koi ehad nahi: agar chahe use bakhsh de aur agar chahe use azab de."
"3243","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch namazein hain jinhein Allah ne bandon par farz kiya; pas jo unhein lekar aaye aur un mein se kisi ko un ke haq ko halka samajh kar zaya na kare to Allah ke paas us ka ehad hai ke use jannat mein dakhil kare; aur jo unhein lekar na aaye to Allah ke paas us ka koi ehad nahi: agar chahe use azab de aur agar chahe use jannat mein dakhil kare."
"3244","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch fasiq janwar hal aur haram donon mein maare jayenge: saanp, chitkabra kawa, chooha, kaatne wala kutta aur cheel."
"3245","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch ka qatl haram mein halal hai: saanp, bichchu, cheel, chooha aur kaatne wala kutta."
"3246","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch sab fasiq hain jinhein muhrim qatl kare aur haram mein qatl kiye jayein: chooha, bichchu, saanp, kaatne wala kutta aur kawa."
"3247","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch ka koi kaffara nahi: Allah ke saath shirk, na-haq jaan ka qatl, momin par bohtan, laraai se bhaagna, aur aisi pakki qasam jis se na-haq maal kaata jaye."
"3248","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch sab fasiq hain jo haram mein qatl kiye jayenge: kawa, cheel, bichchu, chooha aur kaatne wala kutta."
"3249","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Janwaron mein se paanch, muhrim par un ke qatl mein koi gunah nahi: kawa, cheel, chooha, bichchu aur kaatne wala kutta."
"3250","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch fitrat mein se hain: khatna, naaf se neeche baal saaf karna, moonchh kaatna, nakhun tarashna aur baghal ke baal ukherna."
"3251","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch musalman ke haq mein se musalman par hain: salam ka jawab, dawat qubool karna, janaze mein haziri, mareez ki iyadat aur chheenkne wale ko yarhamukallah kehna jab wo Alhamdulillah kahe."
"3252","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo din mein paanch kaam kare Allah use ehl-e-jannat mein likh dega: jo Juma ke din roza rakhe, Juma ke liye jaye, mareez ki iyadat kare, janaze mein hazir ho aur ghulam azaad kare."
"3253","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo in mein se aik kaam kare wo Allah ki zamanat mein hai: jo mareez ki iyadat kare, ya ghazi ban kar nikle, ya apne imam ke paas us ki izzat aur waqar ke liye dakhil ho, ya apne ghar mein baithe ke log us se mehfooz rahein aur wo logon se mehfooz rahe."
"3254","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch, jo in mein se kisi mein qaid ho wo shaheed hai: Allah ke raaste mein qatl hone wala shaheed hai; Allah ke raaste mein doobne wala shaheed hai; Allah ke raaste mein pet ki bimari se marne wala shaheed hai; Allah ke raaste mein taoon se marne wala shaheed hai; aur Allah ke raaste mein bacha jante hue marne wali aurat shaheed hai."
"3255","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Paanch ko siwa Allah ke koi nahi jaanta: Beshak Allah ke paas qayamat ka ilm hai, wo baarish utarta hai, wo jaanta hai jo rehmo mein hai, koi jaan nahi jaanti wo kal kiya kamayegi, aur koi jaan nahi jaanti wo kis zameen mein maregi; beshak Allah janne wala khabar rakhne wala hai."
"3256","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bartan dhaanpo, mashkeeze bandho, darwaze band karo aur shaam ke waqt apne bachchon ko bahar nikalne se roko; kyunke jinno ka phailna aur jhapatna hota hai; aur sone ke waqt chiraagh bujha do; kyunke badkaar choohi kabhi batti ghaseet leti hai aur ghar walon ko jala deti hai."
"3257","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabuwat ki khilafat tees saal hai; phir Allah baadshahat jise chahe dega."
"3258","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare imamon mein behtareen wo hain jin se tum mohabbat karte ho aur wo tum se mohabbat karte hain; tum un par durood bhejte ho aur wo tum par durood bhejte hain. Aur tumhare imamon mein bure wo hain jin se tum bughz rakhte ho aur wo tum se bughz rakhte hain; tum un par laanat karte ho aur wo tum par laanat karte hain."
"3259","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon."
"3260","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo hain jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon, kandhe jhukaye hue; aur tum mein bure bak-bak karne wale, munh phula kar bolne wale aur shekhi maarne wale hain."
"3261","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo qarz ki adayegi mein sab se behtar ho."
"3262","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo umar mein sab se lambe aur akhlaq mein sab se achche hon."
"3263","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo umar mein sab se lambe aur aamaal mein sab se achche hon."
"3264","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo namaz mein kandhe sab se narm rakhein."
"3265","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo apni aurton ke liye behtar hon."
"3266","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo apne ghar walon ke liye behtar ho."
"3267","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein jahiliyyat mein behtar wo Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab deen ki samajh hasil karein."
"3268","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo Quran seekhe aur sikhaye."
"3269","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare naamon mein behtareen Abdullah aur Abdur Rahman aur Haaris hain."
"3270","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek behtareen saathi wo jo apne saathi ke liye behtar ho; aur Allah ke nazdeek behtareen parosi wo jo apne parosi ke liye behtar ho."
"3271","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen jaghein masjidein hain aur buri jaghein bazaar hain."
"3272","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taabi'een mein behtareen Uwais hain."
"3273","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen ghore kaala chamakdar hai jis ki peshani aur thuthna safaid ho aur teen pairon mein safaidi ho jabke dayan pair khula ho; phir agar kaala na ho to surkh-seyah isi nishan par ho."
"3274","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen dua Arafa ke din ki dua hai; aur behtareen jo maine aur mujh se pehle ambiya ne kaha: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi; usi ki baadshahat hai, usi ki hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qadir hai."
"3275","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen rizq guzare ke mutabiq hai."
"3276","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen gawahi wo jo us ka malik mange jane se pehle de."
"3277","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen gawah wo jo apni gawahi mange jane se pehle de."
"3278","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen saathi chaar hain, behtareen daste chaar sau hain, behtareen lashkar chaar hazaar hain; aur baara hazaar kami ki wajah se shikast nahi khate."
"3279","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen meher aasaan-tar hai."
"3280","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqa wo jo ghina baqi rakhe; aur upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai; aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"3281","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqa wo jo ghina ke bawajood ho; aur un se shuru karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"3282","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen amal ye hai ke tum duniya se is haal mein juda ho ke tumhari zaban Allah ke zikr se tar ho."
"3283","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen kamayi kaam karne wale ke haath ki kamayi hai jab wo khairkhwahi kare."
"3284","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen kalaam chaar hain, tumhein nuqsan nahi ke tum in mein se kis se shuru karo: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah aur Allahu Akbar."
"3285","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen majlisein khuli hain."
"3286","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein behtareen wo jis ki zaban aur haath se musalman mehfooz rahein."
"3287","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon."
"3288","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo qarn hai jis mein main hun, phir doosra, phir teesra."
"3289","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo jo logon ko sab se zyada nafa de."
"3290","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo jo adayegi mein sab se behtar ho."
"3291","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo hai jis ka dil jala hua aur zaban sachchi ho. Pucha gaya: Jala hua dil kiya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo parhezgar paak dil hai jis mein na gunah hai, na zulm, na hasad. Pucha gaya: Phir us ke naqsh-e-qadam par kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo duniya se nafrat kare aur aakhirat se mohabbat kare. Pucha gaya: Phir us ke naqsh-e-qadam par kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Achche akhlaq wala momin."
"3292","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Fitnon mein behtareen aadmi wo jo apne ghore ki lagaam pakre Allah ke dushmanon ke peeche ho, unhein darata ho aur wo use darate hon; ya wo aadmi jo jungle mein alag-thalag ho aur Allah ka jo haq us par hai ada karta ho."
"3293","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen mera qarn hai, phir doosra, phir teesra; phir aisi qaum aayegi jin mein koi khair nahi."
"3294","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen mera qarn hai, phir jo un se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon; phir un ke baad aisi qaum aayegi jo motapa pasand karegi aur charbi ko mehboob rakhegi; wo gawahi mange jane se pehle gawahi degi."
"3295","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen mera qarn hai, phir jo un se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon; phir aisi qaumein aayengi jin mein se har aik ki gawahi us ki qasam se pehle hogi aur us ki qasam us ki gawahi se pehle hogi."
"3296","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo jis ki umar lambi ho aur amal achcha ho."
"3297","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen wo jis ki umar lambi ho aur amal achcha ho; aur logon mein bure wo jis ki umar lambi ho aur amal bura ho."
"3298","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen aurat wo jo use khush kare jab wo dekhe, us ki itaat kare jab wo hukm de, aur apne nafs aur apne maal mein us ki mukhalifat na kare jis cheez ko wo napasand kare."
"3299","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen aurat wo jo tumhein khush kare jab tum dekho, tumhari itaat kare jab tum hukm do, aur tumhari ghair-maujudgi mein apne nafs aur tumhare maal ki hifazat kare."
"3300","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen nikah aasaan-tar hai."
"3301","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein behtareen wo qarn hai jis mein main bheja gaya, phir jo un se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon; phir aisi qaum janashin hogi jo motapa pasand karegi; wo mange jane se pehle gawahi degi."
"3302","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mashriq walon mein behtareen Abdul Qais hain."
"3303","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari khajooron mein behtareen Barni hai; bimari door karti hai aur us mein koi bimari nahi."
"3304","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare kapron mein behtareen safaid hain; unhein apne zindon ko pehnao aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan do."
"3305","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare kapron mein behtareen safaid hain; pas apne murdon ko un mein kafan do aur apne zindon ko pehnao; aur tumhare surmon mein behtareen ismid hai: baal ugata hai aur nazar tez karta hai."
"3306","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar ke gharon mein behtareen Banu Najjar hain."
"3307","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ansar ke gharon mein behtareen Banu Abdul Ashhal hain."
"3308","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare deen mein behtareen parhezgari hai."
"3309","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare deen mein behtareen aasaan-tar hai."
"3310","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mardon ki safon mein behtareen pehli hai aur buri aakhri hai; aur aurton ki safon mein behtareen aakhri hai aur buri pehli hai."
"3311","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurton ki behtareen namaz un ke gharon ke andar hai."
"3312","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam mein tum mein behtar wo jo akhlaq mein sab se achche hon jab deen ki samajh hasil karein."
"3313","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo adayegi mein behtar ho."
"3314","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo apne ghar walon ke liye behtar ho; aur main tum mein apne ghar walon ke liye behtar hun."
"3315","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo mere baad mere ghar walon ke liye behtar ho."
"3316","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo aurton ke liye behtar ho."
"3317","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar mera qarn hai, phir jo un se mile hon, phir jo un se mile hon; phir un ke baad aisi qaum hogi jo khayanat karegi aur amanat ke qabil nahi samjhi jayegi; wo gawahi degi aur un se gawahi nahi mangi jayegi; wo nazar manegi aur poori nahi karegi; aur un mein motapa zahir hoga."
"3318","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo khana khilaye aur salam ka jawab de."
"3319","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jo Quran seekhe aur sikhaye."
"3320","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein behtar wo jis ki khair ki ummeed rakhi jaye aur jis ke shar se aman ho; aur tum mein bure wo jis ki khair ki ummeed na rakhi jaye aur jis ke shar se aman na ho."
"3321","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko di gayi behtareen cheez achcha akhlaq hai."
"3322","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen ke chehre par behtareen paani Zamzam ka paani hai: us mein khane se khana hai aur bimari se shifa hai. Aur zameen ke chehre par bura paani Barhoot ki waadi ka paani hai jo Hadramaut ke gumbad mein hai, tiddi ke pairon jaise keere-makoron se; subah behta hai aur shaam ko us mein nami nahi hoti."
"3323","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin se tum ilaaj karte ho un mein behtareen singi lagwana hai."
"3324","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jin se tum ilaaj karte ho un mein behtareen singi lagwana aur samandari qust hai; aur apne bachchon ko halaq ki sozish ke liye ungli se dabane se takleef na do."
"3325","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen jis ki taraf sawariyan dauraayi jayein meri ye masjid aur Bait-e-Ateeq hai."
"3326","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen jo insaan apne peeche chhore teen hain: naik beta jo us ke liye dua kare; jaari sadqa jis ka ajr use pahunchta rahe; aur ilm jis se us ke baad nafa uthaya jaye."
"3327","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aurton ki behtareen masjidein un ke gharon ke andar hain."
"3328","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jahan ki aurton mein behtareen chaar hain: Maryam bint Imran, Khadija bint Khuwailid, Fatima bint Muhammad aur Aasiya Firaun ki biwi."
"3329","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Oonton par sawaar hone wali aurton mein behtareen Quraish ki naik auratein hain: bachpan mein bachche par sab se zyada meherban aur shohar ke maal ki sab se zyada hifazat karne wali."
"3330","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari aurton mein behtareen zyada bachche dene wali, mohabbat karne wali, hamdardi karne wali, mawafiqat karne wali hain jab Allah se darein. Aur tumhari aurton mein buri ban-sanwar kar nikalne wali, itraane wali hain; aur yehi munafiq hain; un mein se jannat mein dakhil nahi hongi magar kaale-safaid paron wale kawe jitni."
"3331","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Un ki aurton mein behtareen Maryam bint Imran hain aur un ki aurton mein behtareen Khadija bint Khuwailid hain."
"3332","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen din jis mein tum singi lagwate ho satrah, unnees aur ikkees hain; aur jab mujhe meraj ki raat farishton ki kisi jamaa't par se guzara gaya to unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, singi lagwana lazim pakro."
"3333","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen din jis par suraj tuloo hua Juma ka din hai: us mein Adam paida kiye gaye, us mein jannat mein dakhil kiye gaye, us mein us se nikale gaye; aur qayamat Juma ke din ke siwa qaim nahi hogi."
"3334","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen din jis mein suraj tuloo hua Juma ka din hai: us mein Adam paida kiye gaye, us mein utare gaye, us mein un ki tauba qubool ki gayi, us mein wo faut hue, aur us mein qayamat qaim hogi; zameen ke chehre par koi janwar nahi magar wo Juma ke din subah se suraj tuloo hone tak qayamat ke darr se kaan lagaye rehta hai, siwa ibn Adam ke; aur us mein aik ghari hai ke jo momin banda namaz mein hote hue use pa le aur Allah se kuch mange to wo use zaroor dega."
"3335","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ikhtiyar diya gaya shafa'at ke aur is ke darmiyan ke meri aadhi ummat jannat mein dakhil ho; to maine shafa'at ko ikhtiyar kiya.......... ..."
"3336","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman amanat-dar khazin jo wo de jo use hukm diya gaya ho poora aur bharpoor, us ka nafs us par khush ho, phir use us tak pahuncha de jis ke liye use hukm diya gaya ho, sadqa dene walon mein se aik hai."
"3337","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mamoon waris hai."
"3338","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mamoon us ka waris hai jis ka koi waris na ho."
"3339","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khaala maa ke darje mein hai."
"3340","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khaala walida hai."
"3341","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere baad meri ummat mein khilafat tees saal hai; phir us ke baad baadshahat hai."
"3342","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khilafat Quraish mein hai, hukm Ansar mein hai, dawat Habsha mein hai, aur jihad aur hijrat musalmanon aur muhajireen mein hai."
"3343","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Makhlooq sab khair sikhane wale par durood bhejti hai yahan tak ke samundar ki machhliyan."
"3344","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab gandagiyon ki maa hai; pas jo use piyega us ki namaz chaalees din qubool nahi hogi; phir agar wo mar jaye jabke wo us ke pet mein ho to jahiliyyat ki maut marega."
"3345","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab behayaiyon ki maa aur kabeera gunahon mein sab se bara hai; jo use piyega wo apni maa, apni khaala aur apni phuphi par girega."
"3346","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab in do darakhton se hai: khajoor aur angoor."
"3347","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khawarij aag ke kutte hain."
"3348","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khair aadat hai aur shar zidd hai; aur jis ke saath Allah khair chahe use deen ki samajh de."
"3349","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khair qayamat ke din tak ghoron ki peshaniyon se bandhi hui hai; aur ghoron par kharch karne wala aise hai jaise apni hatheli kharch se phailaye hue ho, use bandh nahi karta."
"3350","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghore teen hain: Rahman ke liye ghora, shaitan ke liye ghora aur insaan ke liye ghora. Raha Rahman ka ghora to wo jo Allah ke raaste mein bandha jaye; pas us ka chaara, us ki leed aur us ka peshab us ke meezaan mein honge. Aur raha shaitan ka ghora to wo jis par jua khela jaye ya shart lagayi jaye. Aur raha insaan ka ghora to wo ghora jise insaan bandhe aur us se nasal chahe; pas wo faqr se parda hai."
"3351","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ki chamakdar peshaniyon mein khair hai."
"3352","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghore teen ke liye hain: aik aadmi ke liye ajr hain, aik ke liye parda hain aur aik par bojh hain. Raha wo jis ke liye ajr hain to wo aadmi jo unhein Allah ke raaste mein bandhe aur un ke liye charagah ya sabza-zaar mein rassi lambi kare; pas jo un ki rassi mein charagah aur sabza-zaar se lage wo us ke liye nekiyan hongi; aur agar wo apni rassi tor kar aik ya do bulandi charh jayein to un ke nishanaat aur leed us ke liye nekiyan hongi; aur agar wo neher par se guzrein aur piyein jabke us ne unhein pilana nahi chaha tha to ye us ke liye nekiyan hongi. Aur wo aadmi jo unhein be-niyaazi, parda-poshi aur paak-damani ke liye bandhe phir un ki gardano aur peethon mein Allah ka haq na bhoole to wo us ke liye parda hain. Aur wo aadmi jo unhein fakhr, riya aur ehl-e-Islam se dushmani ke liye bandhe to wo us par bojh hain."
"3353","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon se qayamat ke din tak khair bandhi hui hai: ajr aur maal-e-ghaneemat."
"3354","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak khair bandhi hui hai."
"3355","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak khair bandhi hui hai; aur un wale un par madad kiye gaye hain; pas un ki peshaniyon par haath phero, un ke liye barkat ki dua karo; aur unhein haar pehnao, taant ke haar na pehnao."
"3356","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak khair aur barkat bandhi hui hai; aur un wale un par madad kiye gaye hain; unhein haar pehnao aur taant ke haar na pehnao."
"3357","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khema khokhla moti hai jis ki lambayi aasmaan mein saath meel hai; us ke har kone mein momin ke liye ghar wale honge jinhein doosre nahi dekhenge."
